      ],
      "correctAnswer": "c",
      "explanation": "$\\left(\\frac{27}{8}\\right)^{\\frac{2}{3}} = \\frac{27^{\\frac{2}{3}}}{8^{\\frac{2}{3}}} = \\frac{(\\sqrt[3]{27})^2}{(\\sqrt[3]{8})^2} = \\frac{3^2}{2^2} = \\frac{9}{4}$."
